# Run output stays local. The replay cache of agent steps is committed, so CI can replay them without model calls.
**/.e2e/*
!**/.e2e/cache/
# The root ignores package-lock.json because the site uses yarn. This package uses npm, and CI installs from its lockfile.
!package-lock.json
# Replay entries that end on a page with live chain data. Their end anchors (Fuji blocks per minute, a validator
# uptime count, the Fuji supply share) change between runs, so --strict-cache would fail them at random. These
# steps call the model in CI.
.e2e/cache/c3b8aacfff21ca1d699bf7806c7f79a86261b50ff5fe6c027b1a5fe48cb9f969.json
.e2e/cache/d0ab4e1eaa95866af6fe0b7426590d0f3a804ee1dfcd649d72dceecf00557b09.json
.e2e/cache/3de1b65ca41910583c9234c1892a92034cd2b35e804b97c10f533f3b12291017.json
# Replay entries that end on the integrations directory, whose count ('235 integrations') changes with each listing.
.e2e/cache/ea5fcc41fbfea7242264a6166130971cf3b803d3729586bd7a176e357eda12d3.json
.e2e/cache/bacef60c8abab652b4a5bb72c43023ef1b29152c41c33ee97cdd4116d3afb082.json
# Replay entry of the docs search step: two results share the name 'Add Validator', and their order changes
# between deployments, so the recorded tap opens a different page.
.e2e/cache/b4c9f0d3f8dd8470add72ba709f87b6a724f7a1d200345ce956f81c2adbf4d3e.json
# Replay entry of the City view search step (ai/journey-explorer.e2e.ts). In CI the replay reads no start route on
# that page: the step waits about 30 s, then fails as wrong-context while the URL is right. Re-recording does not
# help, so this step calls the model in CI.
.e2e/cache/2c4d5cec1995f39bb3f1ad25eb1041c29a79adf45c129b4db3f512fca4939e23.json
# The output of the Console explore runs (explore/console/e2e.config.ts), the cache folder too: those runs commit nothing.
explore/console/.e2e/
